{
  "batchIndex": 1,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "file:server/api.mjs",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "server/api.mjs",
      "filePath": "server/api.mjs",
      "summary": "后端唯一文件、零 npm 依赖：node:http 提供 REST API 与静态托管；SSH 免密轮询各 GPU 机器采集 nvidia-smi/系统指标与占卡进程；通过 useradd/userdel/chpasswd 管理机器本地账号；含会话认证、失败锁定、审计日志、demo 模式与趋势历史环形缓冲。",
      "tags": ["backend", "ssh", "http", "polling", "auth", "audit", "zero-dependency"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "ESM (.mjs)，仅用 Node 内置模块 http/fs/path/crypto/child_process/url；用 spawn('ssh') 而非 SSH 库，这是零依赖的关键。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:dev.mjs",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "dev.mjs",
      "filePath": "dev.mjs",
      "summary": "开发模式启动器：spawn 两个子进程（server/api.mjs 设 API_PORT=8601、node_modules/vite/bin/vite.js 起 5173），stdio inherit；任一子进程退出即整体 shutdown，SIGINT/SIGTERM 统一收编。",
      "tags": ["dev-tooling", "process", "orchestration"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:shot.mjs",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "shot.mjs",
      "filePath": "shot.mjs",
      "summary": "截图工具：以 CDP（Chrome DevTools Protocol）驱动 headless Chrome，自动填入管理密码点击 #login-btn 登录，可选点击导航，再强制给 .rise 元素加 .in 类触发入场动画，最后 Page.captureScreenshot 保存 PNG。",
      "tags": ["tooling", "screenshot", "cdp", "headless-chrome"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },

    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:loadConfig", "type": "function", "name": "loadConfig", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 48, "lineEnd": 57, "summary": "读取 config.json 与 DEFAULT_CONFIG 合并；读取失败时回写一份默认配置文件。", "tags": ["config", "bootstrap"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:shq", "type": "function", "name": "shq", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 64, "lineEnd": 66, "summary": "单引号转义：把任意字符串安全嵌入远程 shell 脚本，防命令注入。", "tags": ["security", "shell-quoting"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:sshExec", "type": "function", "name": "sshExec", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 68, "lineEnd": 93, "summary": "spawn('ssh') 在目标机器执行脚本：BatchMode + ConnectTimeout=6 + StrictHostKeyChecking=accept-new，带超时 kill，非 0 退出码 reject 并截断错误信息。", "tags": ["ssh", "subprocess", "timeout"], "complexity": "moderate" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:parsePoll", "type": "function", "name": "parsePoll", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 125, "lineEnd": 196, "summary": "解析采集脚本输出：按 @@GPU/@@PROC/@@PS/@@SYS/@@WHO 分段，解析显卡指标、占卡进程（与 ps 结果按 pid 关联出用户与命令）、负载/内存/磁盘与 who 登录列表。", "tags": ["parsing", "nvidia-smi", "metrics"], "complexity": "complex" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:pollMachine", "type": "function", "name": "pollMachine", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 227, "lineEnd": 248, "summary": "单台机器一轮采集：sshExec + parsePoll 写回内存状态，标记 online/last_seen，并把 GPU 利用率、显存、CPU 均值追加进 history（上限 240 点）。", "tags": ["polling", "state", "history"], "complexity": "moderate" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:collectUsers", "type": "function", "name": "collectUsers", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 250, "lineEnd": 275, "summary": "采集某台机器的本地账号：awk 取 /etc/passwd 中 UID≥1000 的普通用户，getent group sudo 标记 sudo 权限；结果缓存 60 秒。", "tags": ["ssh", "accounts", "cache"], "complexity": "moderate" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:hashPassword", "type": "function", "name": "hashPassword", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 277, "lineEnd": 290, "summary": "调用 openssl passwd -6 -stdin 生成 SHA-512 密码哈希，用于 chpasswd -e 免明文传输。", "tags": ["password", "subprocess", "security"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:addUser", "type": "function", "name": "addUser", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 292, "lineEnd": 312, "summary": "在指定机器上创建账号：sudo useradd -m（已存在则 usermod 修正 shell）+ chpasswd -e 写入哈希，可选 usermod -aG sudo；逐机器返回结果并失效用户缓存。", "tags": ["account-management", "ssh", "useradd"], "complexity": "moderate" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:changePasswd", "type": "function", "name": "changePasswd", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 314, "lineEnd": 330, "summary": "在指定机器上重置账号密码（chpasswd -e + 哈希），逐机器返回结果并失效缓存。", "tags": ["account-management", "ssh"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:deleteUser", "type": "function", "name": "deleteUser", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 332, "lineEnd": 351, "summary": "删除账号：先 userdel -r（含家目录），失败再 userdel，最后 id 校验；仍存在则报「可能仍有该用户的进程在运行」。", "tags": ["account-management", "ssh", "userdel"], "complexity": "moderate" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:auditAdd", "type": "function", "name": "auditAdd", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 218, "lineEnd": 225, "summary": "把一次账号操作（动作/用户/机器/成败/详情）unshift 进审计数组，保留 500 条并同步写入 audit.json。", "tags": ["audit", "persistence"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:sha256", "type": "function", "name": "sha256", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 439, "lineEnd": 439, "summary": "计算字符串 SHA-256，用于校验 sha256$ 格式的管理密码。", "tags": ["crypto", "auth"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:checkPassword", "type": "function", "name": "checkPassword", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 441, "lineEnd": 445, "summary": "校验管理密码：支持明文或 sha256$<hex> 哈希两种存储格式。", "tags": ["auth", "security"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:sessionOk", "type": "function", "name": "sessionOk", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 447, "lineEnd": 453, "summary": "从 Cookie 中取 sid 并检查 sessions Map 中的过期时间，判断会话是否有效。", "tags": ["auth", "session", "cookie"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:sendJson", "type": "function", "name": "sendJson", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 469, "lineEnd": 479, "summary": "统一 JSON 响应：设置 Content-Length、nosniff 与 X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN，支持附加响应头（如 Set-Cookie）。", "tags": ["http", "security-headers"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:readBody", "type": "function", "name": "readBody", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 481, "lineEnd": 496, "summary": "读取并解析 JSON 请求体，超过 64KB 直接销毁连接返回空对象，解析失败降级为 {}。", "tags": ["http", "hardening"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:serveStatic", "type": "function", "name": "serveStatic", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 498, "lineEnd": 514, "summary": "生产模式静态文件服务：path.normalize + startsWith(DIST_DIR) 防目录穿越，缺失文件回退 index.html（SPA fallback）。", "tags": ["static", "security", "spa"], "complexity": "moderate" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:handleApi", "type": "function", "name": "handleApi", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 518, "lineEnd": 627, "summary": "API 路由总入口：/api/login 放行，其余接口先过 sessionOk；实现 /api/state、/api/users 与 add/passwd/delete 三个写操作，含用户名正则、密码长度、机器白名单校验与审计写入。", "tags": ["routing", "validation", "api"], "complexity": "complex" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:main", "type": "function", "name": "main", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 652, "lineEnd": 681, "summary": "启动入口：按 demo_mode 决定演示数据循环或 SSH 轮询定时器（间隔下限 5s），监听端口并打印监听地址/密码/采集方式。", "tags": ["bootstrap", "scheduler"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:mulberry", "type": "function", "name": "mulberry", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 423, "lineEnd": 431, "summary": "mulberry32 伪随机数生成器，为 demo 模式提供确定性可复现的模拟数据。", "tags": ["prng", "demo"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:demo.seed", "type": "function", "name": "demo.seed", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 363, "lineEnd": 385, "summary": "demo 模式初始化：用固定种子为每台机器生成初始利用率、显存与若干模拟占卡进程。", "tags": ["demo", "mock-data"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:demo.tick", "type": "function", "name": "demo.tick", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 386, "lineEnd": 412, "summary": "demo 模式心跳：随机游走更新各机器的 GPU 利用率/显存/CPU/内存/磁盘并追加 history，模拟真实采集结果。", "tags": ["demo", "mock-data", "polling"], "complexity": "moderate" },
    { "id": "function:server/api.mjs:demo.users", "type": "function", "name": "demo.users", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 413, "lineEnd": 420, "summary": "demo 模式用户列表：按主机名哈希确定性地挑选若干模拟账号（alice 固定带 sudo）。", "tags": ["demo", "mock-data"], "complexity": "simple" },

    { "id": "endpoint:server/api.mjs:login", "type": "endpoint", "name": "POST /api/login", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 521, "lineEnd": 536, "summary": "登录：校验管理密码，5 次失败锁定 5 分钟；成功颁发随机 token 存入 sessions（12 小时）并下发 HttpOnly SameSite=Strict 的 sid Cookie。", "tags": ["auth", "rate-limit", "cookie"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "endpoint:server/api.mjs:logout", "type": "endpoint", "name": "POST /api/logout", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 540, "lineEnd": 544, "summary": "登出：从 sessions 中删除当前 sid。", "tags": ["auth", "session"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "endpoint:server/api.mjs:state", "type": "endpoint", "name": "GET /api/state", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 546, "lineEnd": 557, "summary": "集群状态快照：机器列表（history 只回传最近 90 点）、poll_interval、demo 标志与最近 60 条审计——前端 5 秒轮询的唯一数据源。", "tags": ["api", "monitoring", "polling"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "endpoint:server/api.mjs:users", "type": "endpoint", "name": "GET /api/users", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 559, "lineEnd": 565, "summary": "列出各机器本地账号：demo 模式返回模拟数据，否则逐台 collectUsers（含 60 秒缓存）。", "tags": ["api", "accounts"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "endpoint:server/api.mjs:users-add", "type": "endpoint", "name": "POST /api/users/add", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 569, "lineEnd": 587, "summary": "批量创建账号：校验用户名正则与密码长度≥6、机器必须在配置内；逐台执行并汇总成败写入审计。", "tags": ["api", "accounts", "write"], "complexity": "moderate" },
    { "id": "endpoint:server/api.mjs:users-passwd", "type": "endpoint", "name": "POST /api/users/passwd", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 589, "lineEnd": 607, "summary": "批量重置密码：同 add 的校验与审计逻辑，逐台 chpasswd -e。", "tags": ["api", "accounts", "write"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "endpoint:server/api.mjs:users-delete", "type": "endpoint", "name": "POST /api/users/delete", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "lineStart": 609, "lineEnd": 624, "summary": "批量删除账号：逐台 userdel 并校验结果，失败原因（如仍有进程在运行）写入审计详情。", "tags": ["api", "accounts", "write"], "complexity": "simple" },

    { "id": "concept:bypass-design", "type": "concept", "name": "旁路设计（Bypass）", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "summary": "GPU 机器上零安装、零 agent：账号落在机器本地 /etc/passwd，采集与控制全部由中心节点经 SSH 完成。中心节点宕机只影响管理台可访问性，机器登录与训练任务不受影响。", "tags": ["architecture", "principle", "reliability"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "concept:ssh-polling", "type": "concept", "name": "SSH 轮询采集", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "summary": "每 poll_interval（默认 10s）对每台机器跑一段 shell 脚本，分段输出 @@GPU/@@PROC/@@PS/@@SYS/@@WHO，中心节点解析后写入内存状态与 history 趋势缓冲。", "tags": ["architecture", "monitoring", "ssh"], "complexity": "moderate" },
    { "id": "concept:demo-mode", "type": "concept", "name": "演示模式（demo_mode）", "filePath": "server/api.mjs", "summary": "config.json 的 demo_mode=true 时用 mulberry32 生成可复现的模拟机器数据，不发起任何 SSH 连接，便于离线预览全部界面。", "tags": ["architecture", "demo", "config"], "complexity": "simple" },

    { "id": "function:dev.mjs:start", "type": "function", "name": "start", "filePath": "dev.mjs", "lineStart": 14, "lineEnd": 27, "summary": "spawn 子进程并注册 exit 回调（非主动停止时触发整体关闭）。", "tags": ["process"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:dev.mjs:shutdown", "type": "function", "name": "shutdown", "filePath": "dev.mjs", "lineStart": 30, "lineEnd": 37, "summary": "幂等地向所有子进程发 SIGTERM 并以同一退出码结束父进程。", "tags": ["process", "signal"], "complexity": "simple" },
    { "id": "function:shot.mjs:main", "type": "function", "name": "main", "filePath": "shot.mjs", "lineStart": 28, "lineEnd": 115, "summary": "启动 headless Chrome、连 CDP WebSocket、设视口、导航、自动登录、可选点击导航、强制入场动画、截图写盘，finally 中清理临时 profile。", "tags": ["cdp", "screenshot"], "complexity": "moderate" },
    { "id": "function:shot.mjs:httpGetJson", "type": "function", "name": "httpGetJson", "filePath": "shot.mjs", "lineStart": 18, "lineEnd": 26, "summary": "GET 一个 URL 并按 JSON 解析，用于轮询 /json/list 获取调试目标。", "tags": ["http", "cdp"], "complexity": "simple" }
  ],
